["10", "11", "12", "13"], "options_hi": ["10", "11", "12", "13"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p><img width=249 height=145 id=\"Picture 6\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p17846/image006.png\"></p><p>There are ten rectangles in the given figure. They are  -  ABDC, CDNM, ABNM, ECMI, EDNI, JKLI, OPQR, STVU, EFGH and CFRW.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=249 height=145 id=\"Picture 6\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p17846/image006.png\"></p><p>There are ten rectangles in the given figure. They are  -  ABDC, CDNM, ABNM, ECMI, EDNI, JKLI, OPQR, STVU, EFGH and CFRW.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the number of triangles in the given figure. </p><p><img width=203 height=96 id=\"Picture 47\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p17346/image050.png\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2310;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p><img width=\"203\" height=\"96\" id=\"Picture 47\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p17346/image050.png\"></p>", "options_en": ["14", "15", "16", "17"], "options_hi": ["14", "15", "16", "17"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p><img width=234 height=127 id=\"Picture 48\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p17346/image051.png\"></p><p>There are sixteen triangles in a given figure. They are ANO, NOM, AOM, AOB, BDO, PDO, BDP, BCD, KJS, JSI, KSI, ISH, RSF, HSF, RFH, FGH. </p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=234 height=127 id=\"Picture 48\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p17346/image051.png\"></p><p>There are sixteen triangles in a given figure. They are ANO, NOM, AOM, AOB, BDO, PDO, BDP, BCD, KJS, JSI, KSI, ISH, RSF, HSF, RFH, FGH. </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_e