p>AOV, ABV, AOB, AQN, AQC, ANP, HUI, HUG, HIG, HJT, HFT, HFJ, MRC, CRD, DRL, MRL, MCD, CDL, DLM, LMC, LSD, DSE, ESK, KSL, LDE, DEK, EKL, KLD, CLE, MDK. </p><p><img width=624 height=224 id=\"Drawing 13\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15650/image014.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>There are thirty triangles in the given figure. </p><p>AOV, ABV, AOB, AQN, AQC, ANP, HUI, HUG, HIG, HJT, HFT, HFJ, MRC, CRD, DRL, MRL, MCD, CDL, DLM, LMC, LSD, DSE, ESK, KSL, LDE, DEK, EKL, KLD, CLE, MDK. </p><p><img width=624 height=224 id=\"Drawing 13\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15650/image014.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>How many triangles are present in the given figure?</p><p><img width=251 height=137 id=\"Picture 40\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p4122/image031.jpg\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2310;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p><p><img width=\"251\" height=\"137\" id=\"Picture 40\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p4122/image031.jpg\"></p>", "options_en": ["14", "18", "16", "12"], "options_hi": ["14", "18", "16", "12"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Let us label the given figure.</p><p><img width=275 height=168 id=\"Picture 41\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p4122/image032.jpg\"></p><p>We will have 18 triangles in the given figure.</p><p>ABD, BCE, BFH, BHJ, BJN, BFJ, DFG, DFK, EIJ, EJL, FGK, FHN, FJN, FBN, HJN, IJL, KMN, LNO.</p><p>Hence 18 are present.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let us label the given figure.</p><p><img width=275 height=168 id=\"Picture 41\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p4122/image032.jpg\"></p><p>We will have 18 triangles in the given figure.</p><p>ABD, BCE, BFH, BHJ, BJN, BFJ, DFG, DFK, EIJ, EJL, FGK, FHN, FJN, FBN, HJN, IJL, KMN, LNO.</p><p>Hence 18 are present.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Count the number of triangles in the given figure.</p><p><img width=194 height=196 id=\"Picture 7\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p8555/image007.jpg\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2310;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2339;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p><img width=\"194\" height=\"196\" id=\"Picture 7\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p8555/image007.jpg\"></p>", "options_en": ["11", "15", "17", "16"], "options_hi": ["11", "15", "17", "16"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p><img width=229 height=237 id=\"Picture 9\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p8555/image008.jpg\"></p><p>ACD, AEM, AFI, BCE, BDJ, BDM, DHI, DJM, DLM, EFG, FHL, FKL, GHJ, GIM, JLM = 15 triangles</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=229 height=237 id=\"Picture 9\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p8555/image008.jpg\"></p><p>ACD, AEM, AFI, BCE, BDJ, BDM, DHI, DJM, DLM, EFG, FHL, FKL, GHJ, GIM, JLM = 15 triangles</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>How many rectangles are there in the given figure?</p><p><img width=231 height=146 id=\"Picture 17\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p10873/image008.jpg\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2310;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2310;&#2351;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p><p><img width=\"231\" height=\"146\" id=\"Picture 17\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p10873/image008.jpg\"></p>", "options_en": ["5", "4", "6", "8"], "options_hi": ["5", "4", "6", "8"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p><img width=272 height=202 id=\"Picture 1\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230302sscrt-001.jpg\" ></p><p>The rectangles are: SVWZ, STYZ, BIJD, BFED, TVWY, FIJE. TUGF and EHXY are squares and All squares are rectangles.</p><p>Hence, there are 8 rectangles</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=272 height=202 id=\"Picture 1\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/other/er230302sscrt-001.jpg\" ></p><p>The rectangles are: SVWZ, STYZ, BIJD, BFED, TVWY, FIJE. TUGF and EHXY are squares and All squares are rectangles.</p><p>Hence, there are 8 rectangles</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the number of triangles in the given figure.</p><p><img width=194 height=169 id=\"Picture 25\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18147/image025.png\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2310;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p><img width=\"194\" height=\"169\" id=\"Picture 25\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18147/image025.png\"></p>", "options_en": ["7", "8", "9", "10"], "options_hi": ["7", "8", "9", "10"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>There are nine triangles in a given figure. They are- ACE, ACD, ADE, CDG, HDE, AEF, AFB, ADG and ADH.</p><p><img width=208 height=182 id=\"Picture 26\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18147/image026.jpg\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>There are nine triangles in a given figure. They are- ACE, ACD, ADE, CDG, HDE, AEF, AFB, ADG and ADH.</p><p><img width=208 height=182 id=\"Picture 26\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18147/image026.jpg\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>How many Lines are there in the given figure?</p><p><img width=292 height=317 id=\"Picture 1\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24659/image005.png\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#